  "narrations": {
    "intro--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "intro--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这份文稿里的动画都是代码写的，用了五个库，都跟着讲授的步骤走。最后，整份讲授一帧一帧导出成视频。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gsap--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "gsap--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "先看 GSAP。例子是字节对编码。三个词 low、lower、lowest，先拆成一个一个字母。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gsap--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "gsap--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "然后数一数，哪两个相邻的字母一起出现得最多。"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-gsap-1",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "pause"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 是 l 和 o，三个词里都有。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gsap--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "gsap--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "把它们合并成一个新符号 lo，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-gsap-1-2",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "spot",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "gsap--bpe"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 词表就多了一项。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gsap--paragraph-4--narration": {
      "id": "gsap--paragraph-4--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "再数一遍，这次 lo 和 w 最多，合并成 low。"
        },
        {
          "type": "pronunciation",
          "display": "BPE",
          "spoken": "B P E"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 就这样一轮一轮地扩充词表。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "anime--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "anime--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这一页用 Anime.js 画编译管线。最左边是源文件，一份讲义只有这一份。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "anime--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "anime--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "编译器把它变成中间表示，也就是 IR。IR 只记语义和算好的结果。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "anime--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "anime--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "渲染端从 IR 里各取所需，生成网页、幻灯片、notebook，还有视频。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "anime--paragraph-4--narration": {
      "id": "anime--paragraph-4--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "视频也出自同一份源文件。你现在听到的讲稿，就是它的脚本。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "motion--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "motion--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这一页用 Motion。柱子的高度是注意力权重。查询词是 cat 的时候，它给自己的权重最大。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "motion--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "motion--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "查询换成 mat。还是这六根柱子，平滑地变到新的高度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "motion--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "motion--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这次权重最大的，是 mat 自己，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-motion-1",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "mark",
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "注意力"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 所以它亮了起来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "three--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "three--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这一页用 Three.js 画三维空间。每个点是一个词向量，一开始散在各处。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "three--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "three--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "训练之后，意思相近的词靠到了一起，聚成三团。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "three--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "three--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "镜头推近其中一团，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-three-1",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "pause"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 这些向量指向差不多的方向。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "remotion--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "remotion--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这个片头是 Remotion 写的，用的是 React 组件。先是标题弹进来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "remotion--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "remotion--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "接着副标题一个字一个字地打出来。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "remotion--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "remotion--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "每一帧的画面只由帧号决定。所以导出视频的时候，每一帧都能准确重现。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "click--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "click--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "这个计数器是文稿自己写的组件。它有一个具名动作，叫“合并一次”，讲稿可以按名字调用它。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "click--paragraph-2--narration": {
      "id": "click--paragraph-2--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "讲授的时候，光标会先移到这个按钮上，等讲稿念到提示。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "click--paragraph-3--narration": {
      "id": "click--paragraph-3--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "讲到这里，"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-click-1",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "click--counter"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "merge"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 点一次，词表多了 lo；"
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-click-3",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "pause"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 再点 "
        },
        {
          "id": "cue-click-5",
          "type": "cue",
          "action": "click",
          "target": {
            "blockId": "click--counter"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "arg": "merge"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " 一次，又多了 low。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "video--paragraph-1--narration": {
      "id": "video--paragraph-1--narration",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "讲稿合成语音后，字幕和提示都排在同一条时间线上。导出时一帧一帧推进，动画、光标和点击都落在讲到它的那一刻。"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
